Error [E0002]: This `{` never gets a matching `}`
  --> tests/ui/interp_unclosed.jet:3:12
    |
  3 |     print("{name")
    |            ^^^^^^^
 Why: `{` inside quoted text starts an interpolated value and needs a closing `}` before the text ends; escaped braces use `{{`/`}}`, while raw backtick strings keep braces literal
 Fix: Add a `}` after the value, write `{{` for an escaped brace, or write the text as ``…`` for raw text
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0002
